# Two views of one history: the same commits before and after a merge, side by side.
title "Before and after a merge"
schema before graph label="before"
mark a box commit label="A"
mark b box commit label="B"
mark c box commit label="C"
link ab arrow a -> b
link bc arrow b -> c
schema after graph label="after"
mark a2 box commit label="A"
mark b2 box commit label="B"
mark c2 box commit label="C"
mark d2 box feature label="D"
mark m2 box merge label="M"
link a2b2 arrow a2 -> b2
link b2c2 arrow b2 -> c2
link b2d2 arrow b2 -> d2
link c2m arrow c2 -> m2
link d2m arrow d2 -> m2
Say: "Two histories, one merge."
